WEBVTT

00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:09.240
One can often find unexpected 
treasures among magic tools.

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:17.740
<b>Doom</b>

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:41.560
<b>m 0 0 l 0 -7 b 7 -7 15 -15 15 -29 l 30 -30 l 29 -15 b 15 -15 7 -7 7 0 b 7 7 15 15 29 15 l 30 30 l 15 29 b 15 15 7 7 0 7 b -7 7 -15 15 -15 29 l -30 30 l -29 15 b -15 15 -7 7 -7 0 b -7 -7 -15 -15 -29 -15 l -30 -30 l -15 -29 b -15 -15 -7 -7 0 -7</b>

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:41.560
<b>My Next Life as a Villainess: 
All Routes Lead to Doom!</b>

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:52.130
<b>Episode 7 
My Wish Was Granted...</b>

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:56.430
Excuse me, Master Wolt.

00:01:56.690 --> 00:01:59.600
Do you know where Lady Larna is?

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:00.820
No...

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:03.500
She's probably either out 
on another undercover investigation

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:06.030
or absorbed in her research of magic tools.

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:07.870
Well, this is a problem...

00:02:07.870 --> 00:02:10.860
There's something I wanted her 
to confirm for me.

00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:13.400
Just put it on the top of the pile.

00:02:15.620 --> 00:02:17.480
Don't tell me these are all...

00:02:17.710 --> 00:02:20.180
They're all awaiting 
Lady Larna's confirmation.

00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:23.660
With this many, I'd say we'll all 
be working through the night tonight.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:31.230
Quite the stressful work environment...

00:02:31.230 --> 00:02:32.070
Yes.

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:36.390
But I'm grateful to have 
a place where I'm needed.

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:38.250
True.

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:42.590
<i>Both he and I were essentially 
taken in by Lady Larna.</i>

00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:46.230
I'm going to atone for my sins and start over.

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:51.180
<i>After that incident, I was ordered to work 
at the Department of Magic.</i>

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:55.900
<i>But I wasn't wanted in any section 
because I could use dark magic.</i>

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:02.910
What? None of you want him in your sections?

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:05.400
I'll take him, then.

00:03:05.850 --> 00:03:09.120
<i>Lady Larna is a top-class officer 
at the Department of Magic,</i>

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:13.100
<i>but other than her status as a noble lady, 
her background is largely unknown.</i>

00:03:19.770 --> 00:03:21.260
Don't fall asleep!

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:24.330
If you sleep now, you won't be able to 
wake up for the next two days!

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:29.790
<i>I'm grateful to both Lady Larna 
and my workplace,</i>

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:32.750
<i>but sometimes I just want to sleep in a bed.</i>

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:37.480
So this is the Department of Magic?

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:39.100
Exciting, isn't it?

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:39.920
Yes.

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:42.110
Lady Catarina! Miss Maria!

00:03:42.310 --> 00:03:44.570
Raphael! And Rufus, too!

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:48.740
So, Rufus, the rumor that you'd joined 
the Department of Magic was true?

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:51.750
Yes, and I go by Sora now.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:52.840
Sora?

00:03:53.390 --> 00:03:54.960
That's a great name!

00:03:58.010 --> 00:04:00.600
Sora works in the same section as me.

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:01.760
Oh, really?

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:04.460
I've been wondering what you were up to!

00:04:02.070 --> 00:04:04.460
<i>The guy who pushed my 
sister down onto a bed...</i>

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:06.350
<i>He can't be trusted.</i>

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:07.560
Really? You were wondering about me?

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:09.150
<i>If he gets any closer to her, he'll pay!</i>

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:10.770
That's right! I was 
really worried, you know!

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.350
Ah, you're here.

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:13.790
I've been waiting for you.

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:19.100
Um... And who might you be?

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:20.560
I'm Larna.

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:22.820
This is how I look 
at the Department of Magic.

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:24.440
Huh?! Lady Larna?!

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:27.530
You really are a master of disguise.

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:30.920
Lady Larna, where have you been?

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:32.900
We'll talk about that later.

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:36.040
I managed to get my hands 
on a rare magic tool.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.350
I wanted to show it to all of you.

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:44.680
This is a wish-granting dollhouse.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.520
A wish-granting...

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:48.220
...dollhouse?

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:52.330
People dream of living different lives 
than they currently have.

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:54.980
It's supposed to realize 
those dreams for them.

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:57.600
Different lives than they currently have?

00:04:57.600 --> 00:05:00.790
So is it something like being reborn?

00:05:00.790 --> 00:05:02.570
How do you use it?

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.270
Lady Larna! What should we do about this?

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:06.230
Lady Larna!

00:05:06.230 --> 00:05:07.940
There's something you need 
to check right away!

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:10.230
Lady Larna! I need your signature!

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:14.660
Fine, fine. I'm coming.

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:16.270
Wait here.

00:05:16.940 --> 00:05:19.210
They all seem awfully tired.

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:21.880
Yes, they're all from our section.

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:24.490
They've been working hard 
with no sleep or breaks.

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:27.470
Lady Larna is out of the office a lot,

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:30.090
so everyone wants to catch 
her whenever they see her.

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:33.810
Shall we have tea while we wait 
for Lady Larna to return?

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:35.280
I will assist you.

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:40.750
This room sure is full 
of strange things, isn't it?

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:42.810
These must be pretty old, too.

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:47.050
Lady Catarina, if you could live a different life 
than what you currently have,

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:48.380
what would you want to do?

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:49.910
Well, I think...

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:54.680
I'd want a two-dimensional dream life as anyone 
but a rich villainess in an otome game,

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:57.630
someone with no doom flags...

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:02.580
Uh... Being surrounded by novels and sweets

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:05.650
and just lazing around 
all the time would be nice!

00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:07.090
What about all of you?

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:10.480
A different life...

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:13.560
I can't say I've never thought about it...

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:21.690
Anyway, this dollhouse is so well made.

00:06:30.010 --> 00:06:31.780
Lady Catarina?! Master Keith?!

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:35.140
They're all gone.

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:37.290
What was that light?

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:38.620
It came from the dollhouse.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:40.650
Light suddenly shot out from it.

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:41.940
Suddenly?

00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:45.000
Does that mean the magic 
tool activated itself?

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:57.340
<i>If I could live a different life 
than what I currently have,</i>

00:06:57.340 --> 00:07:00.110
<i>I'd want to be a bird.</i>

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:03.900
<i>I'd fly through the vast sky, 
sing beautiful melodies...</i>

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:14.750
<i>and I'd kiss the one I love.</i>

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:25.120
H-Hey... Ow! Ow, ow, ow!

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:25.120
I-Is that bird... Prince Alan?

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:29.100
<i>I had no idea Prince Alan wanted to 
be such a cute little bird.</i>

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:31.430
<i>You really can't judge a book by its cover.</i>

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:32.930
Look at this one.

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:39.240
<i>If I could live a different life,</i>

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:40.680
<i>I'd be an animal.</i>

00:07:41.130 --> 00:07:42.520
<i>Maybe a cat.</i>

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:49.230
Oh!

00:07:49.230 --> 00:07:51.710
I have a lovely little visitor.

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:55.820
Good kitty.

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:00.880
Meow.

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:10.090
That's Nicol...

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:13.120
<i>Even as a cat, Master Nicol 
is still Master Nicol.</i>

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:15.640
<i>His devilish smile is still alive and well.</i>

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:20.620
It looks like each one of their dreams 
is coming to life in a different room.

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:30.120
That was such a lovely story.

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:32.190
I wonder if fairies really exist.

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:33.600
We do!

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:40.330
A fairy!

00:08:41.430 --> 00:08:45.980
<i>A fairy makes a vow of eternal 
friendship with a human girl...</i>

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:54.960
<i>And at night, they sleep 
together on the same pillow.</i>

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:57.130
That's so like Lady Sophia.

00:08:57.130 --> 00:09:00.760
<i>It should never be shown 
to Lady Mary, though.</i>

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:02.640
Who's this one?

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:07.070
<i>The other life I'd like to live...</i>

00:09:07.390 --> 00:09:11.630
<i>would be a life of freedom, 
unbound by social status.</i>

00:09:25.380 --> 00:09:29.850
<i>And I would travel the world 
as I please with the one I love.</i>

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:36.760
Wait just a moment!

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:38.300
I'll be going with you!

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:42.160
If Lady Catarina is going, so am I, 
even to the very ends of the earth!

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:45.640
Calm down. 
This is just Prince Geordo's dream.

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:48.420
R-Right...

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:50.780
I wonder where Lady Catarina is.

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:53.120
Could it be she's alone and frightened?

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:58.480
She doesn't even know how to fix 
a crease in a dress or brush her hair...

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:08.580
This is bliss.

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.360
Lady Catarina...

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:14.470
I guess she wished for a life in which 
she wouldn't have to dress herself.

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:18.720
That's so like Lady Catarina.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:20.480
And this is...

00:10:20.480 --> 00:10:21.930
Master Keith?!

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:24.190
I-I can't believe he looks like that!

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:27.070
Lady Mary and Miss Maria are...

00:10:27.070 --> 00:10:28.060
Huh?

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:30.300
They seem to be enjoying themselves.

00:10:30.300 --> 00:10:34.010
They might decide to continue 
living in there forever.

00:10:34.010 --> 00:10:35.370
Live in there forever?

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:37.630
You mean they'd never come back out here?

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:40.300
I'm just saying it's a possibility.

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:43.200
Inside this dollhouse 
is a garden of ideals, after all.

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:47.060
Come to think of it,

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:50.920
I once read an article about 
a group of people who went missing.

00:10:51.340 --> 00:10:53.440
They just disappeared one day,

00:10:53.440 --> 00:10:56.760
and afterward, a dollhouse was left behind.

00:10:57.040 --> 00:11:00.260
I think it was nine people 
that disappeared then.

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:02.810
Nine? That's odd.

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:05.150
It looks like there are only eight rooms.

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:08.430
Well, I suppose it does 
have an interesting history.

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:12.680
Lady Larna, is there a way 
to bring them back to this world?

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:14.380
According to the antiquarian,

00:11:14.380 --> 00:11:16.820
there's a doll inside the dollhouse,

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:20.150
and if that doll is put to sleep, 
they can then return to this world.

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:22.260
Put a doll to sleep?

00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:28.410
Understood. I'll go and save them.

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:31.070
Please allow me to assist you, as well.

00:11:31.070 --> 00:11:32.070
And me!

00:11:32.070 --> 00:11:33.920
You should stay here, Sora.

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:36.720
Come after us if anything happens.

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:39.460
All right.

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:41.610
Once you two enter this dollhouse,

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:44.240
there's no telling what 
effects it will have.

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:47.100
There's a chance not 
everyone will make it back.

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:52.020
I have long been prepared to do 
whatever I must for Lady Catarina's sake.

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:54.060
We'll be back. You can count on it.

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:59.280
Very well. I'll be waiting.

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:02.680
How do we get inside, though?

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:04.860
Knowing Lady Catarina,

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:07.760
she probably just fiddled 
with it like this without thinking...

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:16.040
All right! This is getting interesting now!

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:19.120
I wonder what's going to happen!

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:20.430
<i>Lady Larna's actually enjoying this...</i>

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:25.380
There's a doll in here somewhere, right?

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:26.400
Yes.

00:12:26.670 --> 00:12:29.090
For now, let's just look around everywhere.

00:12:29.090 --> 00:12:30.760
I'll check upstairs.

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:31.600
All right.

00:12:50.430 --> 00:12:53.120
<i>If I could live another life...</i>

00:12:56.770 --> 00:12:59.000
<i>I'd be bulging with muscles!</i>

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:02.170
<i>Then I could make lots 
and lots of sweets and other dishes!</i>

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:11.620
<i>I'll save that room for later.</i>

00:13:12.380 --> 00:13:13.270
<i>Next!</i>

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:23.470
<i>If I could live another life,</i>

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:26.720
<i>I'd be someone ranking even higher 
than Prince Geordo.</i>

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:30.410
<i>Then I could proudly and boldly 
snatch Lady Catarina away from him!</i>

00:13:43.950 --> 00:13:46.060
<i>I'll save that one for later, too.</i>

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:47.080
<i>Next!</i>

00:13:49.070 --> 00:13:50.690
<i>Maybe it's due to my sister's influence,</i>

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:53.560
<i>but I just don't understand 
how ordinary girls think.</i>

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:57.120
<i>So if I could life a different life...</i>

00:13:57.890 --> 00:14:01.640
Hurry, hurry! We're going to be late!

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:03.940
<i>It really is Master Keith!</i>

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:05.450
Brother!

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:10.200
Keith, there's no need 
to be in such a hurry.

00:14:10.650 --> 00:14:13.410
<i>And Lady Catarina is a man, too?!</i>

00:14:13.690 --> 00:14:16.140
Good morning, Master Catarina.

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:20.080
I've been waiting for you.

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:24.780
You were up late reading romance 
novels again, weren't you?

00:14:25.310 --> 00:14:29.050
Am I correct in assuming 
you skipped breakfast?

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:31.760
Please have some of these muffins later.

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:35.070
<i>So does that mean all the men are...</i>

00:14:38.650 --> 00:14:39.820
Greetings.

00:14:41.430 --> 00:14:43.740
Greetings, Catarina.

00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:46.810
Greetings.

00:14:48.520 --> 00:14:51.490
You all seem to be well today.

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:54.920
Catarina, let me fix that bed hair for you.

00:14:54.920 --> 00:14:56.250
Come over here.

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:59.010
I should do that. I'm better with my hands.

00:14:59.010 --> 00:15:01.200
<i>I</i> should do that, since I'm his sister.

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:05.960
Wait a moment, please.

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:10.520
That is my job.

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:16.220
Me?!

00:15:19.710 --> 00:15:21.760
What a great book.

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:25.090
It's so nice being able to 
live a lazy life like this.

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:28.440
"Lady Catarina, do you intend 
to loaf around forever?"

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:31.070
There's no one to scold me 
like that, either.

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:35.810
Come to think of it, where is Anne, anyway?

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:37.900
Oh, right.

00:15:38.270 --> 00:15:41.790
I left with everyone to go 
to the Department of Magic,

00:15:42.110 --> 00:15:45.210
and we were sucked into that dollhouse...

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:48.280
So this is the inside of that dollhouse?!

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:52.910
What's this?

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:05.850
I wasn't expecting to run into myself...

00:16:05.850 --> 00:16:06.860
Anne!

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:08.110
Lady Catarina?!

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:10.730
Are you the real Lady Catarina?

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:13.690
Not the Lady Catarina of someone's fantasy?!

00:16:13.690 --> 00:16:15.080
What are you talking about?

00:16:15.080 --> 00:16:16.940
Of course I'm me.

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:20.750
Thank goodness... Lady Catarina...

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:25.600
I see.

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:28.290
So that's how this place works.

00:16:28.540 --> 00:16:29.750
Okay, got it.

00:16:29.750 --> 00:16:33.010
Let's join up with Raphael 
and find that doll.

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:33.920
Right.

00:16:33.920 --> 00:16:36.370
Master Raphael headed upstairs.

00:16:43.680 --> 00:16:45.440
There's a room here, too.

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:47.200
The ninth room?

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:51.400
Hey, can you come here for a sec?

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:52.440
Great, thanks.

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:54.070
Anything I can help out with?

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:59.350
That should do it for the paperwork.

00:16:59.640 --> 00:17:00.610
Excellent.

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:06.460
Another day gone as planned. 
All done with work.

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:07.580
Good work today.

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:08.880
Thank. Same to you.

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:11.920
Master Raphael!

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:14.270
Raphael, I heard everything.

00:17:14.270 --> 00:17:17.370
Let's find that doll 
and get back to our own world!

00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:19.720
There's no need for that.

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:20.720
Huh?

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:24.180
Just look at this 
fantastic work environment.

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:27.230
We work from nine in the morning 
to five in the afternoon,

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:28.940
and of course, there's no overtime.

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:32.180
We all get to go home 
and sleep in our beds at night.

00:17:32.180 --> 00:17:34.200
It's the ideal work environment.

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:36.040
Um...

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:38.570
Well, that's nice... I guess?

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:41.050
Let's drop the idea 
of going back to our old world

00:17:41.050 --> 00:17:43.210
and keep living here together!

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:44.330
Huh?!

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:47.620
Master Raphael, do you really mean that?

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:50.860
This is just a dream! It's not reality!

00:17:50.860 --> 00:17:53.880
We have to find that doll 
and go back to our own world!

00:17:54.280 --> 00:17:55.380
Doll?

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:58.750
Don't you think <i>we</i> are really the dolls?

00:17:59.330 --> 00:18:04.420
Dolls meant to live happily 
in this dollhouse forever...

00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:07.670
I want to go back to the real world!

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:09.980
There are so many things I haven't done yet!

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:12.410
It's time to harvest the pumpkins,

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:15.550
and I need to eat the sweets I was hiding.

00:18:15.550 --> 00:18:17.910
I'm in trouble if Mother finds them.

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:19.820
Where did you hide them?

00:18:19.960 --> 00:18:23.840
Is that more important 
than having your wish granted?

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:24.910
Um...

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:28.250
I think what's important 
is different for everyone...

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:30.330
But... how do I say this?

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:32.990
If you were suddenly to disappear 
from our own world,

00:18:32.990 --> 00:18:34.550
it would make people sad.

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:36.300
It would?

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:37.440
Yes.

00:18:37.440 --> 00:18:40.300
There are people waiting 
for you to come home, remember?

00:18:40.670 --> 00:18:43.800
I'm sure you'll remember 
the real world soon enough,

00:18:43.800 --> 00:18:47.760
and when you do, you'll regret all this 
and it'll always weigh on you.

00:18:49.220 --> 00:18:50.730
<i>You're right.</i>

00:18:51.140 --> 00:18:55.120
<i>There are still many 
things I need to teach Sora,</i>

00:18:55.770 --> 00:18:59.520
<i>and I haven't repaid my debt 
to Lady Larna for taking me in.</i>

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:04.080
<i>If I disappear, it'll mean 
more work for my colleagues.</i>

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:09.630
Plus, I want to go back 
to our own world with you!

00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:12.380
I can't imagine a world without you!

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:26.010
A doll?

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:27.480
Could that be...

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:47.660
We have things we need 
to do in our own world!

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:49.710
We have to go back!

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:52.790
Wind magic?!

00:20:03.540 --> 00:20:04.700
Raphael!

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:09.350
Lady Catarina?!

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:11.900
What are you doing?! Please come back!

00:20:21.690 --> 00:20:22.840
What's this?

00:20:32.240 --> 00:20:34.330
Huh? It stopped?

00:20:34.760 --> 00:20:36.860
It appears to be asleep.

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:39.960
Now everyone will be set free.

00:20:41.390 --> 00:20:44.160
I'm not sure what's going on, but...

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:45.360
Good.

00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:48.090
Okay! Let's all go home!

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:02.200
Is this...

00:21:02.200 --> 00:21:05.290
You all seemed to be 
having some nice dreams.

00:21:05.290 --> 00:21:06.320
Dreams?

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:08.410
It was a beautiful dream.

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:10.960
Anyway, I'm so glad we made it back!

00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:14.840
Welcome back. I see you're all safe.

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:18.750
So it would seem the doll 
is the master of the house...

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:21.260
Sleep in peace.

00:21:21.930 --> 00:21:23.860
Now, for a change of pace,

00:21:23.860 --> 00:21:26.080
I'll show you around the Departmen—

00:21:24.900 --> 00:21:26.080
Lady Larna.

00:21:26.440 --> 00:21:29.840
Why don't you take care of your 
mountain of paperwork first?

00:21:30.240 --> 00:21:32.540
Come, now! Time to get to work!

00:21:33.740 --> 00:21:36.180
Okay, next time, then!

00:21:42.490 --> 00:21:45.570
That dream felt amazingly real, though...

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:47.740
What was your dream? Tell me!

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:50.110
It would be best not to inquire further.

00:21:50.110 --> 00:21:51.640
Really? Why?

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:54.070
For the sake of peace in everyone's hearts.

00:21:54.070 --> 00:21:56.550
Huh? What does that mean?

00:21:56.550 --> 00:21:58.960
There are some things you're 
better off not knowing.

00:22:00.760 --> 00:22:04.190
Come on! Tell me!

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:48.670
<b>Secret Catarina</b>

00:22:54.850 --> 00:22:55.520
<b>Secret Catarina</b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:03.900
<b>Secret Catarina</b>

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:10.860
<b>Secret Catarina</b>
